        set {_lore1::9} to "&8&m⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯"
        set {_lore1::10} to "&e▸ Nhấp chuột để Mua Rank VIP!"
        set slot 11 of {_inv} to makeGlowingItem(iron ingot, "&b&l✦ GÓI RANK: [VIP] ✦", {_lore1::*})

        # Rank KING (700 Coin)
        delete {_lore2::*}
        set {_lore2::1} to "&8&m⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯"
        set {_lore2::2} to "&8▪ &7Hạng Rank: &e&l[KING] &8(Vĩnh Viễn)"
        set {_lore2::3} to "&8▪ &7Giá: &6700 Coin &7($7,000,000 tham chiếu)"
        set {_lore2::4} to ""
        set {_lore2::5} to "&6✦ ĐẶC QUYỀN RANK KING ✦"
        set {_lore2::6} to "&f • &7Bao gồm toàn bộ quyền hạn &b[VIP]"
        set {_lore2::7} to "&f • &a+10%% Giá Bán tài nguyên tại &e/sellgui"
        set {_lore2::8} to "&f • &eLệnh mở hòm Ender di động: &e/enderchest"
        set {_lore2::9} to "&f • &dHiệu ứng phát sáng & Chat màu nổi bật"
        set {_lore2::10} to "&8&m⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯"
        set {_lore2::11} to "&e▸ Nhấp chuột để Mua Rank KING!"
        set slot 13 of {_inv} to makeGlowingItem(gold ingot, "&e&l✦ GÓI RANK: [KING] ✦", {_lore2::*})

        # Rank MASTER (1,500 Coin)
        delete {_lore3::*}
        set {_lore3::1} to "&8&m⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯"
        set {_lore3::2} to "&8▪ &7Hạng Rank: &d&l[MASTER] &8(Vĩnh Viễn)"
        set {_lore3::3} to "&8▪ &7Giá: &61,500 Coin &7($15,000,000 tham chiếu)"
        set {_lore3::4} to ""
        set {_lore3::5} to "&6✦ ĐẶC QUYỀN RANK MASTER ✦"
        set {_lore3::6} to "&f • &7Bao gồm toàn bộ quyền hạn &e[KING]"
        set {_lore3::7} to "&f • &a+20%% Giá Bán tài nguyên tại &e/sellgui"
        set {_lore3::8} to "&f • &cLệnh hồi phục tức thời: &e/feed &f& &e/heal"
        set {_lore3::9} to "&f • &6Danh hiệu Bá Chủ Độc Quyền máy chủ"
        set {_lore3::10} to "&8&m⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯"
        set {_lore3::11} to "&e▸ Nhấp chuột để Mua Rank MASTER!"
        set slot 15 of {_inv} to makeGlowingItem(diamond, "&d&l✦ GÓI RANK: [MASTER] ✦", {_lore3::*})

        openStandardUI({_p}, {_inv}, "UI_CSHOP_1", "UI_CSHOP")

    else if {_tab} is 2:
        # Tab 2: Bảo Vật Ác Quỷ & Thiên Phú (36 ô)
        set {_inv} to createStandardUI({_p}, "UI_CSHOP_2", "&8✦ &c&lBẢO VẬT ÁC QUỶ & THIÊN PHÚ &8✦", 4, apple named " ", "UI_CSHOP", "Cửa Hàng /cshop")
        setupCoinShopItem({_inv}, 10, makeCustomRPItem("bounty_poster", "&e&l✦ LỆNH TRUY NÃ HẢI TẶC ✦", ("&7Treo thưởng PvP người chơi")), 10, "Lệnh Truy Nã")
        setupCoinShopItem({_inv}, 11, makeCustomRPItem("rumble_ball", "&e&l✦ VIÊN BIẾN HÌNH RUMBLE BALL ✦", ("&7Bột thuốc gia tăng năng lực Quái Thú")), 15, "Rumble Ball")
        setupCoinShopItem({_inv}, 12, makeCustomRPItem("talent_reset", "&6&l✦ QUẢ CẦU TẨY THIÊN PHÚ ✦", ("&7Tẩy toàn bộ 4 chỉ số Thiên Phú và hoàn 100%% điểm")), 30, "Quả Cầu Tẩy Điểm")
        setupCoinShopItem({_inv}, 13, makeCustomRPItem("unidentified_df", "&d&l✦ TRÁI ÁC QUỶ BÍ ẨN ✦", ("&7Trái cây thần bí chưa giám định")), 50, "Trái Ác Quỷ Bí Ẩn")
        setupCoinShopItem({_inv}, 14, makeCustomRPItem("df_remover", "&c&l✦ THUỐC XÓA TRÁI ÁC QUỶ ✦", ("&7Thanh tẩy năng lực an toàn tại Vegapunk")), 100, "Thuốc Xóa Ác Quỷ")
        setupCoinShopItem({_inv}, 15, makeCustomRPItem("awakening_stone", "&6&l✦ ĐÁ THỨC TỈNH ÁNH SAO 3D ✦", ("&7Thức Tỉnh cảnh giới tối thượng Lv.100")), 150, "Đá Thức Tỉnh")
        setupCoinShopItem({_inv}, 16, makeCustomRPItem("awakening_talisman", "&e&l✦ BÙA THỨC TỈNH TINH TÚ ✦", ("&7Bùa hộ mệnh Thức Tỉnh năng lực")), 200, "Bùa Thức Tỉnh")
        setupCoinShopItem({_inv}, 22, makeCustomRPItem("df_chest", "&5&l✦ RƯƠNG TRÁI ÁC QUỶ THẦN BÍ ✦", ("&7Mở ngẫu nhiên 1 trong 8 Trái Ác Quỷ")), 250, "Rương Trái Ác Quỷ")
        openStandardUI({_p}, {_inv}, "UI_CSHOP_2", "UI_CSHOP")

    else if {_tab} is 3:
        # Tab 3: Rương AoV & Phù Phép CE (36 ô)
        set {_inv} to createStandardUI({_p}, "UI_CSHOP_3", "&8✦ &b&lRƯƠNG AOV & PHÙ PHÉP CRAZYENCHANTS &8✦", 4, book named " ", "UI_CSHOP", "Cửa Hàng /cshop")
        setupCoinShopItem({_inv}, 11, makeGlowingItem(sugar, "&a&l✦ BỤI PHÙ PHÉP TỶ LỆ +15%% (CE) ✦", ("&7Tăng 15%% tỷ lệ thành công khi đập sách CE")), 35, "Bụi Phù Phép CE")
        setupCoinShopItem({_inv}, 13, makeGlowingItem(paper, "&f&l✦ ĐÁ BẢO HIỂM PHÙ PHÉP WHITE SCROLL ✦", ("&7Bảo vệ trang bị không bị phá hủy khi ép xịt CE")), 50, "White Scroll CE")
        setupCoinShopItem({_inv}, 15, makeCustomRPItem("aov_chest", "&6&l✦ RƯƠNG TRANG BỊ LIÊN QUÂN 3D ✦", ("&7Mở ngẫu nhiên 1 trong 12 Trang Bị AoV")), 160, "Rương AoV 3D")
        openStandardUI({_p}, {_inv}, "UI_CSHOP_3", "UI_CSHOP")

    else if {_tab} is 4:
        # Tab 4: Lối Tắt 3 Xưởng Sức Mạnh (36 ô)
        set {_inv} to createStandardUI({_p}, "UI_CSHOP_4", "&8✦ &d&lLỐI TẮT 3 ĐẠI XƯỞNG RÈN RPG &8✦", 4, anvil named " ", "UI_CSHOP", "Cửa Hàng /cshop")
        set slot 10 of {_inv} to makeCustomRPItem("aov_chest", "&6&l✦ XƯỞNG 12 TRANG BỊ LIÊN QUÂN ✦", ("&8&m⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯" and "&7Thanh toán 100%% bằng Coin (120 - 350 Coin/món)." and "&7Không cần quặng, không cần Money phụ!" and "" and "&6▸ Nhấp để mở /shopaov"))
        set slot 12 of {_inv} to makeGlowingItem(diamond chestplate, "&c&l✦ LÒ RÈN 3 BỘ GIÁP TIER 1-3 ✦", ("&8&m⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯" and "&7Rèn trọn bộ giáp Hộ Vệ, Huyết Chiến, Bất Diệt." and "&7Thanh toán thuần Coin (20 - 260 Coin/mảnh)!" and "" and "&c▸ Nhấp để mở /rengiap"))
        set slot 14 of {_inv} to makeGlowingItem(diamond pickaxe, "&e&l✦ RÈN VŨ KHÍ & CÔNG CỤ FARM ✦", ("&8&m⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯" and "&7Rèn Kiếm, Cung, Cúp, Rìu Farm Huyền Thoại." and "&7Thanh toán thuần Coin (70 - 120 Coin)!" and "" and "&e▸ Nhấp để mở /rencongcu"))
        set slot 16 of {_inv} to makeCustomRPItem("yoru", "&a&l✦ XƯỞNG 13 DANH KIẾM ONE PIECE ✦", ("&8&m⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯" and "&7Rèn 13 Tuyệt Phẩm Kiếm: Yoru, Enma, Gryphon..." and "&7Thanh toán thuần Coin (60 - 1,200 Coin)!" and "" and "&a▸ Nhấp để mở /danhkiem"))
        openStandardUI({_p}, {_inv}, "UI_CSHOP_4", "UI_CSHOP")

function setupCoinShopItem(inv: inventory, sl: number, it: item, price: number, nameStr: text):
    delete {_lore::*}
    set {_lore::1} to "&8&m⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯"
    set {_lore::2} to "&8▪ &7Vật phẩm: &f%{_nameStr}%"
    set {_lore::3} to "&8▪ &7Giá Niêm Yết: &6%{_price}% Coin"
    set {_lore::4} to ""
    set {_lore::5} to "&a▸ Nhấp chuột để Mua x1!"
    set {_lore::6} to "&8&m⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯⎯"
    add {_lore::*} to lore of {_it}
    set slot {_sl} of {_inv} to {_it}

# =====================================================================
# PHẦN 4: XỬ LÝ CLICK & CHỐNG SHIFT-CLICK CHO TOÀN BỘ GIAO DIỆN KINH TẾ
# =====================================================================

on InventoryDragEvent:
    set {_who} to event.getWhoClicked()
    set {_u} to uuid of {_who}
    if {ui_active::%{_u}%} is "UI_BANK" or "UI_SHOP" or "UI_SHOP_1" or "UI_SHOP_2" or "UI_SHOP_3" or "UI_SHOP_4" or "UI_CSHOP" or "UI_CSHOP_1" or "UI_CSHOP_2" or "UI_CSHOP_3" or "UI_CSHOP_4":
        cancel event

on inventory click:
    set {_u} to uuid of player
    set {_activeUI} to {ui_active::%{_u}%}
    if {_activeUI} is not "UI_BANK":
        if {_activeUI} does not contain "UI_SHOP":
            if {_activeUI} does not contain "UI_CSHOP":
                stop

    cancel event
    if "%click type%" contains "SHIFT" or "NUMBER" or "DOUBLE" or "SWAP" or "DROP":
        player.updateInventory()
        stop
    if clicked inventory is not player's current inventory:
        stop

    set {_slot} to index of event-slot

    # Nhường các ô điều hướng đáy cho 99_ui_router.sk (Hàng 4: 27, 28, 35 | Hàng 6: 45, 46, 53)
    if {_slot} is 27 or 28 or 35 or 45 or 46 or 53:
        stop

    # -------------------------------------------------------------
    # 1. GIAO DỊCH TẠI NGÂN HÀNG (UI_BANK)
    # -------------------------------------------------------------
    if {_activeUI} is "UI_BANK":
        set {_pBal} to player's balance
        set {_coinBal} to getCoinBalance(player)

        # Đổi Money -> Coin
        if {_slot} is 10:
            executeExchangeMoneyToCoin(player, 1)
        else if {_slot} is 11:
            executeExchangeMoneyToCoin(player, 10)
        else if {_slot} is 12:
            executeExchangeMoneyToCoin(player, 50)
        else if {_slot} is 13:
            executeExchangeMoneyToCoin(player, 100)
        else if {_slot} is 14:
            set {_maxCoins} to floor({_pBal} / {@exchange_rate})
            if {_maxCoins} < 1:
                sendSystemMsg(player, "error", "Bạn không có đủ $10,000 để đổi Coin!")
                play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to player
                stop
            executeExchangeMoneyToCoin(player, {_maxCoins})

        # Lối tắt sang CShop
        else if {_slot} is 16:
            set {ui_bank_return::%{_u}%} to "UI_BANK"
            wait 1 tick
            openCoinShopHubGUI(player)

        # Rút Coin -> Money
        else if {_slot} is 19:
            executeExchangeCoinToMoney(player, 1)
        else if {_slot} is 20:
            executeExchangeCoinToMoney(player, 10)
        else if {_slot} is 21:
            executeExchangeCoinToMoney(player, 50)
        else if {_slot} is 22:
            executeExchangeCoinToMoney(player, 100)
        else if {_slot} is 23:
            if {_coinBal} < 1:
                sendSystemMsg(player, "error", "Bạn không có Coin nào trong tài khoản để rút!")
                play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to player
                stop
            executeExchangeCoinToMoney(player, {_coinBal})

        # Lối tắt sang Shop
        else if {_slot} is 25:
            set {ui_bank_return::%{_u}%} to "UI_BANK"
            wait 1 tick
            openResourceShopHubGUI(player)
        stop

    # -------------------------------------------------------------
    # 2. HUB SIÊU THỊ TÀI NGUYÊN (UI_SHOP)
    # -------------------------------------------------------------
    if {_activeUI} is "UI_SHOP":
        if {_slot} is 10:
            wait 1 tick
            openResourceShopCategoryGUI(player, 1)
        else if {_slot} is 11:
            wait 1 tick
            openResourceShopCategoryGUI(player, 2)
        else if {_slot} is 12:
            wait 1 tick
            openResourceShopCategoryGUI(player, 3)
        else if {_slot} is 14:
            wait 1 tick
            openResourceShopCategoryGUI(player, 4)
        else if {_slot} is 16:
            wait 1 tick
            close player's inventory
            delete {ui_active::%{_u}%}
            delete {ui_parent::%{_u}%}
            wait 1 tick
            make player execute command "sellgui"
        else if {_slot} is 22:
            set {ui_bank_return::%{_u}%} to "UI_SHOP"
            wait 1 tick
            openBankExchangeGUI(player)
        stop

    # -------------------------------------------------------------
    # 3. GIAN HÀNG CON SIÊU THỊ (UI_SHOP_1..4)
    # -------------------------------------------------------------
    if {_activeUI} is "UI_SHOP_1":
        handleShopPurchase(player, 1, {_slot}, "%click type%")
        stop
    else if {_activeUI} is "UI_SHOP_2":
        handleShopPurchase(player, 2, {_slot}, "%click type%")
        stop
    else if {_activeUI} is "UI_SHOP_3":
        handleShopPurchase(player, 3, {_slot}, "%click type%")
        stop
    else if {_activeUI} is "UI_SHOP_4":
        handleShopPurchase(player, 4, {_slot}, "%click type%")
        stop

    # -------------------------------------------------------------
    # 4. HUB CỬA HÀNG COIN (UI_CSHOP)
    # -------------------------------------------------------------
    if {_activeUI} is "UI_CSHOP":
        if {_slot} is 10:
            wait 1 tick
            openCoinShopTabGUI(player, 1)
        else if {_slot} is 12:
            wait 1 tick
            openCoinShopTabGUI(player, 2)
        else if {_slot} is 14:
            wait 1 tick
            openCoinShopTabGUI(player, 3)
        else if {_slot} is 16:
            wait 1 tick
            openCoinShopTabGUI(player, 4)
        else if {_slot} is 22:
            set {ui_bank_return::%{_u}%} to "UI_CSHOP"
            wait 1 tick
            openBankExchangeGUI(player)
        stop

    # -------------------------------------------------------------
    # 5. TAB CON CỬA HÀNG COIN (UI_CSHOP_1..4)
    # -------------------------------------------------------------
    if {_activeUI} is "UI_CSHOP_1":
        handleCShopRankPurchase(player, {_slot})
        stop
    else if {_activeUI} is "UI_CSHOP_2":
        handleCShopItemPurchase(player, {_slot})
        stop
    else if {_activeUI} is "UI_CSHOP_3":
        handleCShopChestCEPurchase(player, {_slot})
        stop
    else if {_activeUI} is "UI_CSHOP_4":
        if {_slot} is 10:
            wait 1 tick
            openAoVShopGUI(player)
        else if {_slot} is 12:
            wait 1 tick
            openArmorForgeMainGUI(player)
        else if {_slot} is 14:
            wait 1 tick
            openGearForgeGUI(player)
        else if {_slot} is 16:
            wait 1 tick
            openMeitoForgeGUI(player)
        stop

# =====================================================================
# PHẦN 5: CÁC HÀM XỬ LÝ GIAO DỊCH KINH TẾ (ATOMIC TRANSACTION)
# =====================================================================

function executeExchangeMoneyToCoin(p: player, coinAmt: number):
    set {_u} to uuid of {_p}
    set {_cost} to round({_coinAmt} * {@exchange_rate})
    if {_p}'s balance < {_cost}:
        sendSystemMsg({_p}, "economy", "Bạn không đủ tiền mặt! Cần &a$%routerFormatNumber({_cost})%&f để mua &6%{_coinAmt}% Coin&f.")
        play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
        stop
    remove {_cost} from {_p}'s balance
    giveCoinBalance({_p}, {_coinAmt})
    sendSystemMsg({_p}, "economy", "Giao dịch thành công! Đã đổi &a$%routerFormatNumber({_cost})% &fsang &6+%{_coinAmt}% Coin&f.")
    play sound "ENTITY_EXPERIENCE_ORB_PICKUP" with volume 1 and pitch 1.2 to {_p}
    wait 1 tick
    openBankExchangeGUI({_p})

function executeExchangeCoinToMoney(p: player, coinAmt: number):
    set {_u} to uuid of {_p}
    set {_reward} to round({_coinAmt} * {@exchange_rate})
    if takeCoinBalance({_p}, {_coinAmt}) is false:
        sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Bạn không đủ Coin! Cần có &6%{_coinAmt}% Coin&f.")
        play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
        stop
    add {_reward} to {_p}'s balance
    sendSystemMsg({_p}, "economy", "Rút Coin thành công! Đã rút &6%{_coinAmt}% Coin &fđổi lấy &a+$%routerFormatNumber({_reward})% Money&f.")
    play sound "ENTITY_PLAYER_LEVELUP" with volume 1 and pitch 1.4 to {_p}
    wait 1 tick
    openBankExchangeGUI({_p})

function handleShopPurchase(p: player, cat: number, sl: number, clickStr: text):
    set {_u} to uuid of {_p}
    set {_isRight} to false
    if {_clickStr} contains "RIGHT":
        set {_isRight} to true

    # Khối Xây Dựng
    if {_cat} is 1:
        if {_sl} is 10:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, cobblestone, 800, 3200, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Đá Cuội")
        else if {_sl} is 11:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, stone, 1200, 4800, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Đá Mịn")
        else if {_sl} is 12:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, oak wood plank, 1600, 6400, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Gỗ Sồi")
        else if {_sl} is 13:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, birch wood plank, 1600, 6400, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Gỗ Bạch Dương")
        else if {_sl} is 14:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, spruce wood plank, 1600, 6400, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Gỗ Vân Sam")
        else if {_sl} is 15:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, dirt, 1600, 6400, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Khối Đất")
        else if {_sl} is 16:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, grass, 3200, 12800, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Khối Cỏ")
        else if {_sl} is 19:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, sand, 1600, 6400, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Khối Cát")
        else if {_sl} is 20:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, glass, 2400, 9600, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Kính Trong Suốt")
        else if {_sl} is 21:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, quartz block, 6400, 25600, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Đá Thạch Anh")
        else if {_sl} is 22:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, sea lantern, 8000, 32000, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Đèn Biển")
        else if {_sl} is 23:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, obsidian, 16000, 64000, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Hắc Diện Thạch")

    # Nông Sản & Thú
    else if {_cat} is 2:
        if {_sl} is 10:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, wheat seeds, 1600, 6400, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Hạt Lúa Giống")
        else if {_sl} is 11:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, carrot, 1600, 6400, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Cà Rốt")
        else if {_sl} is 12:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, potato, 1600, 6400, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Khoai Tây")
        else if {_sl} is 13:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, pumpkin seeds, 1600, 6400, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Hạt Bí Ngô")
        else if {_sl} is 14:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, melon seeds, 1600, 6400, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Hạt Dưa Hấu")
        else if {_sl} is 15:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, sugar canes, 3200, 12800, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Cây Mía Đường")
        else if {_sl} is 16:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, cactus, 3200, 12800, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Xương Rồng")
        else if {_sl} is 19:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, nether wart, 3200, 12800, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Bướu Địa Ngục")
        else if {_sl} is 20:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, soul sand, 4800, 19200, 16, 64, {_isRight}, "Cát Linh Hồn")
        else if {_sl} is 21:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, water bucket, 2000, 10000, 1, 5, {_isRight}, "Xô Nước")
        else if {_sl} is 22:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, lava bucket, 2000, 10000, 1, 5, {_isRight}, "Xô Dung Nham")
        else if {_sl} is 29:
            executeShopBuyEgg({_p}, "PIG", 15000, 75000, 1, 5, {_isRight}, "Trứng Heo")
        else if {_sl} is 30:
            executeShopBuyEgg({_p}, "SHEEP", 15000, 75000, 1, 5, {_isRight}, "Trứng Cừu")
        else if {_sl} is 31:
            executeShopBuyEgg({_p}, "COW", 15000, 75000, 1, 5, {_isRight}, "Trứng Bò")
        else if {_sl} is 32:
            executeShopBuyEgg({_p}, "VILLAGER", 150000, 750000, 1, 5, {_isRight}, "Trứng Dân Làng")

    # Khoáng Sản
    else if {_cat} is 3:
        if {_sl} is 10:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, coal, 300, 4800, 1, 16, {_isRight}, "Than Đá")
        else if {_sl} is 11:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, iron ingot, 800, 12800, 1, 16, {_isRight}, "Thỏi Sắt")
        else if {_sl} is 12:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, gold ingot, 1200, 19200, 1, 16, {_isRight}, "Thỏi Vàng")
        else if {_sl} is 13:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, redstone, 500, 8000, 1, 16, {_isRight}, "Bột Đá Đỏ")
        else if {_sl} is 14:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, lapis lazuli, 500, 8000, 1, 16, {_isRight}, "Ngọc Lưu Ly")
        else if {_sl} is 15:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, diamond, 3500, 56000, 1, 16, {_isRight}, "Kim Cương")
        else if {_sl} is 16:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, emerald, 5000, 80000, 1, 16, {_isRight}, "Ngọc Lục Bảo")
        else if {_sl} is 19:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, blaze rod, 2500, 40000, 1, 16, {_isRight}, "Que Quỷ Lửa")
        else if {_sl} is 20:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, ender pearl, 3000, 48000, 1, 16, {_isRight}, "Ngọc Ender")
        else if {_sl} is 21:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, cobweb, 400, 6400, 1, 16, {_isRight}, "Mạng Nhện")
        else if {_sl} is 22:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, golden apple, 20000, 100000, 1, 5, {_isRight}, "Táo Vàng")
        else if {_sl} is 23:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, shield, 10000, 10000, 1, 1, {_isRight}, "Khiên Gỗ")
        else if {_sl} is 24:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, totem of undying, 150000, 150000, 1, 1, {_isRight}, "Totem Bất Tử")
        else if {_sl} is 25:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, nether star, 250000, 250000, 1, 1, {_isRight}, "Ngôi Sao Địa Ngục")

    # Uy Danh & Spawners
    else if {_cat} is 4:
        if {_sl} is 10:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, diamond block, 35000, 35000, 1, 1, {_isRight}, "Khối Kim Cương")
        else if {_sl} is 11:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, emerald block, 50000, 50000, 1, 1, {_isRight}, "Khối Lục Bảo")
        else if {_sl} is 12:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, beacon, 300000, 300000, 1, 1, {_isRight}, "Beacon Căn Cứ")
        else if {_sl} is 13:
            executeShopBuy({_p}, dragon egg, 800000, 800000, 1, 1, {_isRight}, "Trứng Rồng Ender")
        else if {_sl} is 19:
            executeShopBuySpawner({_p}, "zombie", 20000, "Spawner Zombie")
        else if {_sl} is 20:
            executeShopBuySpawner({_p}, "skeleton", 20000, "Spawner Skeleton")
        else if {_sl} is 21:
            executeShopBuySpawner({_p}, "creeper", 35000, "Spawner Creeper")
        else if {_sl} is 22:
            executeShopBuySpawner({_p}, "spider", 35000, "Spawner Spider")
        else if {_sl} is 23:
            executeShopBuySpawner({_p}, "blaze", 50000, "Spawner Blaze")
        else if {_sl} is 24:
            executeShopBuySpawner({_p}, "iron_golem", 350000, "Spawner Iron Golem")

function executeShopBuy(p: player, it: item, p1: number, p2: number, q1: number, q2: number, isRight: boolean, nameStr: text):
    set {_price} to {_p1}
    set {_amt} to {_q1}
    if {_isRight} is true:
        if {_q2} > {_q1}:
            set {_price} to {_p2}
            set {_amt} to {_q2}

    if {_p}'s balance < {_price}:
        sendSystemMsg({_p}, "economy", "Bạn không đủ tiền! Cần &a$%routerFormatNumber({_price})% Money&f để mua &e%{_amt}%x %{_nameStr}%&f.")
        play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
        stop

    remove {_price} from {_p}'s balance
    giveItemSafely({_p}, {_amt} of {_it})
    sendSystemMsg({_p}, "economy", "Mua thành công &a%{_amt}%x %{_nameStr}% &7(&c-$%routerFormatNumber({_price})%&7)!")
    play sound "ENTITY_ITEM_PICKUP" with volume 1 and pitch 1.2 to {_p}

function executeShopBuyEgg(p: player, mob: text, p1: number, p2: number, q1: number, q2: number, isRight: boolean, nameStr: text):
    set {_price} to {_p1}
    set {_amt} to {_q1}
    if {_isRight} is true:
        if {_q2} > {_q1}:
            set {_price} to {_p2}
            set {_amt} to {_q2}

    if {_p}'s balance < {_price}:
        sendSystemMsg({_p}, "economy", "Bạn không đủ tiền! Cần &a$%routerFormatNumber({_price})% Money&f để mua &e%{_amt}%x %{_nameStr}%&f.")
        play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
        stop

    remove {_price} from {_p}'s balance
    execute console command "ws give %name of {_p}% egg %{_mob}% %{_amt}%"
    sendSystemMsg({_p}, "economy", "Mua thành công &a%{_amt}%x %{_nameStr}% &7(&c-$%routerFormatNumber({_price})%&7)!")
    play sound "ENTITY_ITEM_PICKUP" with volume 1 and pitch 1.2 to {_p}

function executeShopBuySpawner(p: player, mob: text, price: number, nameStr: text):
    if {_p}'s balance < {_price}:
        sendSystemMsg({_p}, "economy", "Bạn không đủ tiền! Cần &a$%routerFormatNumber({_price})% Money&f để mua &d%{_nameStr}%&f.")
        play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
        stop
    remove {_price} from {_p}'s balance
    execute console command "ws give %name of {_p}% spawner %{_mob}% 1"
    sendSystemMsg({_p}, "economy", "Mua thành công &d%{_nameStr}% &7(&c-$%routerFormatNumber({_price})%&7)!")
    play sound "ENTITY_PLAYER_LEVELUP" with volume 1 and pitch 1.3 to {_p}

function handleCShopRankPurchase(p: player, sl: number):
    set {_pName} to name of {_p}
    if {_sl} is 11:
        # Rank VIP (300 Coin)
        if {_p} has permission "rank.vip":
            sendSystemMsg({_p}, "warning", "Bạn đã sở hữu Rank VIP trở lên rồi!")
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
            stop
        if takeCoinBalance({_p}, 300) is false:
            sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Bạn không đủ Coin! Cần có &6300 Coin&f để mua Rank VIP.")
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
            stop
        execute console command "lp user %{_pName}% parent set vip"
        syncPlayerNametagTeam({_p})
        broadcastDualCard("&e&l✦ THĂNG HẠNG RANK", "%{_pName}% đã nâng cấp thành công Rank [VIP] Vĩnh Viễn!", "Nhận quyền bay /is fly & +5%% tiền bán tại /sellgui!")
        play sound "UI_TOAST_CHALLENGE_COMPLETE" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
        wait 1 tick
        openCoinShopTabGUI({_p}, 1)

    else if {_sl} is 13:
        # Rank KING (700 Coin)
        if {_p} has permission "rank.king":
            sendSystemMsg({_p}, "warning", "Bạn đã sở hữu Rank KING trở lên rồi!")
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
            stop
        if takeCoinBalance({_p}, 700) is false:
            sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Bạn không đủ Coin! Cần có &6700 Coin&f để mua Rank KING.")
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
            stop
        execute console command "lp user %{_pName}% parent set king"
        syncPlayerNametagTeam({_p})
        broadcastDualCard("&e&l✦ THĂNG HẠNG RANK", "%{_pName}% đã nâng cấp thành công Rank [KING] Vĩnh Viễn!", "Nhận toàn bộ quyền VIP, /enderchest & +10%% tiền bán tại /sellgui!")
        play sound "UI_TOAST_CHALLENGE_COMPLETE" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
        wait 1 tick
        openCoinShopTabGUI({_p}, 1)

    else if {_sl} is 15:
        # Rank MASTER (1,500 Coin)
        if {_p} has permission "rank.master":
            sendSystemMsg({_p}, "warning", "Bạn đã đạt cảnh giới Rank MASTER cao nhất rồi!")
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
            stop
        if takeCoinBalance({_p}, 1500) is false:
            sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Bạn không đủ Coin! Cần có &61,500 Coin&f để mua Rank MASTER.")
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
            stop
        execute console command "lp user %{_pName}% parent set master"
        syncPlayerNametagTeam({_p})
        broadcastDualCard("&6&l✦ THĂNG HẠNG TỐI CAO", "%{_pName}% đã đăng quang Rank [MASTER] Vĩnh Viễn!", "Mở khóa toàn bộ đặc quyền máy chủ & +20%% tiền bán tại /sellgui!")
        play sound "UI_TOAST_CHALLENGE_COMPLETE" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
        wait 1 tick
        openCoinShopTabGUI({_p}, 1)

function handleCShopItemPurchase(p: player, sl: number):
    if {_sl} is 10:
        # Wanted Poster (10 Coin)
        if takeCoinBalance({_p}, 10) is false:
            sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Bạn không đủ Coin! Cần &610 Coin&f.")
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
            stop
        giveItemSafely({_p}, getWantedPosterItem())
        sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Mua thành công &e1x Lệnh Truy Nã Hải Tặc &7(-10 Coin)!")
        play sound "ENTITY_PLAYER_LEVELUP" with volume 1 and pitch 1.3 to {_p}

    else if {_sl} is 11:
        # Rumble Ball (15 Coin)
        if takeCoinBalance({_p}, 15) is false:
            sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Bạn không đủ Coin! Cần &615 Coin&f.")
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
            stop
        giveItemSafely({_p}, getRumbleBallItem())
        sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Mua thành công &e1x Rumble Ball &7(-15 Coin)!")
        play sound "ENTITY_PLAYER_LEVELUP" with volume 1 and pitch 1.3 to {_p}

    else if {_sl} is 12:
        # Talent Reset (30 Coin)
        if takeCoinBalance({_p}, 30) is false:
            sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Bạn không đủ Coin! Cần &630 Coin&f.")
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
            stop
        giveItemSafely({_p}, createResetScroll())
        sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Mua thành công &61x Quả Cầu Tẩy Điểm Thiên Phú &7(-30 Coin)!")
        play sound "ENTITY_PLAYER_LEVELUP" with volume 1 and pitch 1.3 to {_p}

    else if {_sl} is 13:
        # Unidentified DF (50 Coin)
        if takeCoinBalance({_p}, 50) is false:
            sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Bạn không đủ Coin! Cần &650 Coin&f.")
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
            stop
        giveItemSafely({_p}, getUnidentifiedFruitItem())
        sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Mua thành công &d1x Trái Ác Quỷ Bí Ẩn &7(-50 Coin)!")
        play sound "ENTITY_PLAYER_LEVELUP" with volume 1 and pitch 1.3 to {_p}

    else if {_sl} is 14:
        # DF Remover (100 Coin)
        if takeCoinBalance({_p}, 100) is false:
            sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Bạn không đủ Coin! Cần &6100 Coin&f.")
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
            stop
        giveItemSafely({_p}, getFruitRemoverItem())
        sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Mua thành công &c1x Thuốc Xóa Trái Ác Quỷ &7(-100 Coin)!")
        play sound "ENTITY_PLAYER_LEVELUP" with volume 1 and pitch 1.3 to {_p}

    else if {_sl} is 15:
        # Awakening Stone (150 Coin)
        if takeCoinBalance({_p}, 150) is false:
            sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Bạn không đủ Coin! Cần &6150 Coin&f.")
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
            stop
        giveItemSafely({_p}, getAwakeningStoneItem())
        sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Mua thành công &61x Đá Thức Tỉnh Ánh Sao 3D &7(-150 Coin)!")
        play sound "ENTITY_PLAYER_LEVELUP" with volume 1 and pitch 1.3 to {_p}

    else if {_sl} is 16:
        # Awakening Talisman (200 Coin)
        if takeCoinBalance({_p}, 200) is false:
            sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Bạn không đủ Coin! Cần &6200 Coin&f.")
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
            stop
        giveItemSafely({_p}, getAwakeningTalismanItem())
        sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Mua thành công &e1x Bùa Thức Tỉnh Tinh Tú &7(-200 Coin)!")
        play sound "ENTITY_PLAYER_LEVELUP" with volume 1 and pitch 1.3 to {_p}

    else if {_sl} is 22:
        # DF Chest (250 Coin)
        if takeCoinBalance({_p}, 250) is false:
            sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Bạn không đủ Coin! Cần &6250 Coin&f.")
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
            stop
        giveItemSafely({_p}, getRandomFruitChestItem())
        sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Mua thành công &51x Rương Trái Ác Quỷ Thần Bí &7(-250 Coin)!")
        play sound "ENTITY_PLAYER_LEVELUP" with volume 1 and pitch 1.3 to {_p}

function handleCShopChestCEPurchase(p: player, sl: number):
    set {_pName} to name of {_p}
    if {_sl} is 11:
        # Bụi CE (35 Coin)
        if takeCoinBalance({_p}, 35) is false:
            sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Bạn không đủ Coin! Cần &635 Coin&f.")
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
            stop
        execute console command "ce dust Success 1 %{_pName}% 15"
        sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Mua thành công &a1x Bụi Tăng Tỷ Lệ +15%% (CE) &7(-35 Coin)!")
        play sound "ENTITY_PLAYER_LEVELUP" with volume 1 and pitch 1.3 to {_p}

    else if {_sl} is 13:
        # White Scroll CE (50 Coin)
        if takeCoinBalance({_p}, 50) is false:
            sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Bạn không đủ Coin! Cần &650 Coin&f.")
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
            stop
        execute console command "ce scroll White 1 %{_pName}%"
        sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Mua thành công &f1x Đá Bảo Hiểm Phù Phép White Scroll &7(-50 Coin)!")
        play sound "ENTITY_PLAYER_LEVELUP" with volume 1 and pitch 1.3 to {_p}

    else if {_sl} is 15:
        # Rương AoV (160 Coin)
        if takeCoinBalance({_p}, 160) is false:
            sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Bạn không đủ Coin! Cần &6160 Coin&f.")
            play sound "ENTITY_VILLAGER_NO" with volume 1 and pitch 1 to {_p}
            stop
        giveItemSafely({_p}, createAoVChest())
        sendSystemMsg({_p}, "talent", "Mua thành công &61x Rương Trang Bị Liên Quân 3D &7(-160 Coin)!")
        play sound "ENTITY_PLAYER_LEVELUP" with volume 1 and pitch 1.3 to {_p}

# =====================================================================
# PHẦN 6: HỆ THỐNG CÂU LỆNH ĐIỀU HƯỚNG (/nganhang, /shop, /cshop)
# =====================================================================

command /nganhang:
    aliases: /doitien, /bank, /exchange
    trigger:
        set {ui_bank_return::%uuid of player%} to "UI_ROOT"
        openBankExchangeGUI(player)

command /shop:
    aliases: /cuahang, /sieuthi
    trigger:
        openResourceShopHubGUI(player)

command /cshop:
    aliases: /coinshop, /shopcoin
    trigger:
        openCoinShopHubGUI(player)


# =====================================================================
# BẢO VỆ & GHI ĐÈ ƯU TIÊN TUYỆT ĐỐI CHO CÁC LỆNH KINH TẾ
# =====================================================================

on command "/shop" or "/cuahang" or "/sieuthi":
    cancel event
    set {ui_shop_return::%uuid of player%} to "UI_G6_C"
    openResourceShopHubGUI(player)

on command "/cshop" or "/coinshop" or "/shopcoin":
    cancel event
    set {ui_cshop_return::%uuid of player%} to "UI_G6_C"
    openCoinShopHubGUI(player)

on command "/nganhang" or "/doitien" or "/bank" or "/exchange":
    cancel event
    set {ui_bank_return::%uuid of player%} to "UI_ROOT"
    openBankExchangeGUI(player)
